OL,3,GNEWSAAnalysing 500 million calls fell
OL,4,Ato one person, Omagh bomb inquiry hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwenty-nine people - including a woman
OL,7,Fpregnant with twins - died in the bomb
OL,8,Fin the County Tyrone town on 15 August
OL,9,F1998. It was the biggest single
OL,10,Fatrocity in the Troubles.
